      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The proposed technology of rehabilitative treatment of the patients presenting with bronchial asthma and excessive body weight is based on the selective approach and physical rehabilitation programs adapted to the specific requirements of individual patients. It is shown that the dosed high-intensity physical exercises with the use of ergo-training simulators make up a safe and efficacious tool for the treatment of overweight asthmatic patients."},
